        "Added four named constants (MAX_CREDENTIAL_ID_LENGTH=100, MAX_CREDENTIAL_LABEL_LENGTH=200, MAX_CREDENTIAL_HOST_LENGTH=253, MAX_CREDENTIAL_TOKEN_LENGTH=500) to src/config/config.constants.ts.",
        "Updated src/server/routes/config.ts to import and use these constants in the PUT /api/config/credentials handler length-validation block; error messages now use the spec-compliant format: '\"<field>\" exceeds maximum length of <max> characters.'",
        "Updated src/config/config.ts parseGitCredentials() to import and use the same constants in the per-field length limits array.",
