        },
        {
          "type": "convention",
          "priority": "low",
          "timestamp": "2026-06-29T09:12:26Z",
          "note": "The error message format was inconsistent between the route handler (Field \"id\" must not exceed N characters.) and the config parser (gitCredentials[i].id must not exceed N characters (got M).). The route handler messages have been updated to the spec-compliant format (\"id\" exceeds maximum length of 100 characters.), while the config parser retains its more diagnostic format (includes got-count) which is appropriate for startup/parse errors."
        },
        {
          "type": "improvement",
          "priority": "low",
          "timestamp": "2026-06-29T09:12:26Z",
          "note": "constraints.md already had the per-field length limits table (added by a prior agent in this rework cycle) along with the host/credential coherence and hostname-format sections. No further documentation changes were required for this WP."
