          "priority": "low",
          "timestamp": "2026-06-29T09:16:43Z",
          "note": "A03 — Injection (PASS): No injection vectors identified. The host field rejects '/', '\\', null bytes, and whitespace via regex before the length check. All credential fields are stored as JSON config values — not interpolated into shell commands, SQL queries, or template engines within the modified code."
