        {
          "type": "improvement",
          "priority": "low",
          "timestamp": "2026-06-29T09:16:43Z",
          "note": "A06 — Vulnerable Components (PASS): No new third-party dependencies were introduced by this WP. Only named constants were added to config.constants.ts and imported into existing modules. No CVE review required."
        },
        {
